"still advertises it. It also enables native Wayland in Proton-GE, where "
"Steam Overlay is broken and Steam Input may be unreliable."
msgstr ""
"Aktiverar den äldre PROTON_ENABLE_HDR vägen endast när den valda Proton-"
"bygget fortfarande annonserar den. Det möjliggör också native Wayland i "
"Proton-GE, där Steam Overlay är trasigt och Steam Input kan vara opålitligt."

#: src/launch-options/launch-option-catalog.vala:1254
msgid ""
"Only available in custom Proton builds that still support PROTON_ENABLE_HDR"
msgstr ""

#: src/launch-options/launch-option-catalog.vala:1255
msgid "Disable custom-Proton automatic HDR"
msgstr "Stäng av automatisk HDR i anpassade Proton-byggen"

#: src/launch-options/launch-option-catalog.vala:1255
msgid ""
"Sets DXVK_NO_HDR=1 for custom Proton builds such as current Proton-CachyOS "
